{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Adah the daughter of Elon.</b> She is Basemath the daughter of Elon, and she was called Basemath because she would burn incense to idolatry." "<b>Aholibamah.</b> She is Judith, and he nicknamed her Judith, to say that she denies idolatry, in order to deceive his father." "<b>The daughter of Anah, the daughter of Zibeon.</b> If the daughter of Anah, then not the daughter of Zibeon? Anah was the son of Zibeon, as it says ״וְאֵלֶּה בְנֵי צִבְעוֹן וְאַיָּה וַעֲנָה״. It teaches that Zibeon lay with his daughter-in-law, the wife of Anah, and Aholibamah was born of the two of them, and Scripture informs you that all of them were children of mamzerut."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:14.101677889Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}